# Atlas Core Mobile Navigation Architecture and Telemetry Spec
**Author:** Mint Nkosi  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D16 09:35  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Data-driven design specification for the mobile navigation overhaul on Atlas Core, establishing viewport token metrics, reachability indexes, and telemetry tracking schemas derived from enterprise operational standards.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "project": "Atlas Core",
  "module": "Mobile Navigation Overhaul",
  "author": "Mint Nkosi (Design)",
  "status": "Ready for Implementation",
  "reference_documents": {
    "Business Document: Company Document": "Used to align navigation hierarchy with corporate role-based access controls, hybrid SaaS/Face-to-Face booking workflows, and enterprise viewport support baselines (min 360px viewport width, 99.4% device coverage)."
  },
  "telemetry_baselines": {
    "touch_target_min_dp": 48,
    "thumb_zone_reachability_index": 0.88,
    "max_interaction_depth": 2,
    "target_interaction_latency_ms": 100
  },
  "component_tokens": {
    "bottom_bar_height": "64px",
    "safe_area_bottom_padding": "env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 16px)",
    "icon_bounding_box": "24px x 24px",
    "label_font_size": "11px",
    "active_indicator_stroke": "2px",
    "z_index_overlay": 1100
  },
  "navigation_nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav_saas_dashboard",
      "label": "Dashboard",
      "weight": 1,
      "telemetry_event": "nav.click.dashboard",
      "role_access": ["admin", "operator", "client"]
    },
    {
      "id": "nav_f2f_services",
      "label": "F2F Bookings",
      "weight": 2,
      "telemetry_event": "nav.click.f2f_schedule",
      "role_access": ["admin", "field_agent", "client"]
    },
    {
      "id": "nav_atlas_core_insights",
      "label": "Telemetry",
      "weight": 3,
      "telemetry_event": "nav.click.telemetry",
      "role_access": ["admin", "operator"]
    }
  ],
  "validation_criteria": {
    "error_rate_threshold": "<0.005% miss-taps",
    "time_to_first_action_sec": "<=1.2s"
  }
}
```